...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

user: 사용자 { class: person }
ui: Streamlit UI { class: ours }
deep_research: "Deep Research 에이전트" { class: ext }
session: 세션 상태 { class: store }

user -> ui: 태스크 체크박스 선택 + "Start Deep Research" 클릭
ui -> session: plan_id 조회
ui -> deep_research: "interactions.create(agent, previous_interaction_id, background=True)"
deep_research -> ui: Interaction(id, status=in_progress)
ui -> deep_research: "interactions.get(id) — 3초 간격 반복"
deep_research -> ui: Interaction(status, steps) — 앱은 .outputs를 읽음
ui -> session: research_id·research_text 저장
ui -> user: 리서치 결과 렌더
